re><img alt=\"畢夏（微博@畢夏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250501/994694306319568896507693.png/H4WIm350nw5A6OSQdfTXpQ92-c6RFbBZqIphSKiKYUg\"/><figcaption>畢夏（微博@畢夏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畢夏（微博@畢夏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250501/994694296621813760278631.png/yjRiySwY6E-s2Oaoz3MSHV1IBvo23bcrPrcv2j63L9o\"/><figcaption>畢夏（微博@畢夏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畢夏（微博@畢夏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250501/994694299113361408176845.png/0quKypCabL2n-6yKQy4Ik58EGUNkAnr-LV39Hi1d_R4\"/><figcaption>畢夏（微博@畢夏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畢夏（微博@畢夏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250501/994694301231616000237854.png/iJ4lHfrroe7AJz3_B9-X0hkQxFUSbF06vH7klrx-5JY\"/><figcaption>畢夏（微博@畢夏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畢夏（微博@畢夏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250501/994694303333093376163950.png/d2jEHPmfvgctyVylQfj6Pzfyi-Y9jmeaDKMmLQyjJi0\"/><figcaption>畢夏（微博@畢夏）</figcaption></figure><p>槍手包圍特斯拉狂轟數十槍！22歲饒舌歌手血濺加油站慘死</p><p>巡演嘉賓挺巴勒斯坦遭除名　紅髮艾德：主辦方決定</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T04:58:25.691208+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1812,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}